(% class="legend-box" %)
**Legend:** (% style="color:#f1c40f" %)🏆 Best-in-slot(%%) · (% style="color:#7fdbff" %)⭐ Strong endgame(%%) · (% style="color:#b39ddb" %)🟣 Rare/Ex(%%) · (% style="color:#fff176" %)🟡 Rare(%%) · Links go to **bg-wiki.com**.

(% class="legend-box" %)
**RUN runs four sets.** **Tank** (VIT/DEF/DT-/Enmity), **Lunge / Swipe** (INT/MAB/M.Acc — rune element matters), **Vivacious Pulse / cures** (MND + Healing Magic Skill), **Enhancing Magic** (Phalanx/Refresh/Storms — Enhancing Skill).

(% class="legend-box" %)
**Runes are your toolkit.** Each rune adds elemental damage to your attacks, boosts resistance to its element, and feeds Lunge/Swipe/Gambit. Stack 3 of the same rune for max effect.

{{toc/}}

----

= Trust Recommendations =

You tank — Regen / Phalanx / Vallation / Valiance / Pflug / Battuta / One for All / Liement / Lunge / Rayke. Need: Haste, less MP support than PLD, raw DPS to clear faster.

{{html clean="false"}}
<table class="gt">
<thead><tr><th style="width:60px;">Slot</th><th style="width:200px;">Trust</th><th>Why</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td class="lv">1</td><td>✨ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Ferreous_Coffin">Ferreous Coffin</a></strong></td><td>Haste on all, **Raise III safety net**, Refresh II passive, prioritizes status removal on top enmity (you)</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">2</td><td>🌿 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Cherukiki">Cherukiki</a></strong></td><td>**Regen +5/tick stacks with your Regen**, Haste on you, Protect/Shell, Silence on mob</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">3</td><td>🎵 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Joachim">Joachim</a></strong></td><td>March/Madrigal/Elegy + backup cure + full status removal</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">4</td><td>⚔️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Gilgamesh">Gilgamesh</a></strong></td><td>Hasso/Third Eye/Meditate — pure melee, WS at 1000 TP ASAP</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">5</td><td>🦁 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Lion">Lion</a></strong></td><td>4 interrupt gambits (Grapeshot stun on WS/MS/JA/cast) — supplements your Stun</td></tr>
