= 📋 Endgame Set Cheat-Sheet =

(% class="legend-box" %)
**Stack runes carefully.** The active rune element drives Lunge/Swipe damage and feeds Gambit/Rayke. Match your obi/staff/INT gear to the active rune for big magic damage spikes.

