<tr><td><strong>WS (Resolution / Sanguine Blade / Dimidiation)</strong></td><td>Hecatomb Cap · Kirin's Osode / Mirke Wardecors · Hecatomb Mittens · Hecatomb Leggings · Warwolf Belt · Cerberus Mantle +1 · Light/Flame Gorget · Rajas + Mars's Ring · Brutal Earring</td></tr>
